        "text": "SUSE-2026-15,SUSE-SLE-Module-Python3-15-SP7-2026-15,SUSE-SLE-Product-SLES-15-SP6-LTSS-2026-15,SUSE-SLE-Product-SLES_SAP-15-SP6-2026-15,openSUSE-SLE-15.6-2026-15",
